OL,3,AEight killed in Peruvian military
OL,4,Ahelicopter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight military personnel have been
OL,7,Fkilled in a helicopter crash in a
OL,8,Fremote area of Peru known for growing
OL,9,Fand trafficking drugs.
OL,11,FAuthorities say the aircraft came down
OL,12,Fnear the town of Sanabamba during a
OL,13,Fmission to evacuate an army patrol in
OL,14,Fthe valley of the Apurimac, Ene, and
OL,15,FMantaro rivers, known by its Spanish
OL,16,Facronym VRAEM.
OL,18,FOften referred to as 'Cocaine Valley',
OL,19,Fthe area is Peru's largest coca-growing
OL,20,Fvalley where gangs and the remnants of
OL,21,Fthe former Shining Path rebel group
OL,22,Foperate.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
