OL,3,AEight killed in Peruvian military
OL,4,Ahelicopter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Peruvian ministry of defence said
OL,7,Fthe pilot was the sole survivor of the
OL,8,Fcrash, the cause of which is still
OL,9,Funknown.
